WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
An answer is only as good as its evidence.

00:03.500 --> 00:06.500
ContextTrace. Follow the answer. Find the evidence.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.000
An AI answer says to page the on-call engineer above a 4% error rate.
The selected runbook says 2%.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
ContextTrace flags the claim as contradicted by its cited evidence.
Illustrated workflow using a fictional example.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.500
Correct the answer to 2% and verify the corrected trace.
The answer is now supported by the selected source.

00:19.500 --> 00:25.000
Keep the fix in CI. Replay the saved regression case.
Two traces. Four checks. Passing locally.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.500
ContextTrace. Make every answer inspectable.
Local-first. Open source. Built for developers.

00:28.500 --> 00:32.000
pip install contexttrace
